    "regime_notes": "Positive across the evaluated recent regimes: IC 0.03144 in 2026-08-26 to 2029-12-31, 0.07904 in 2030-01-01 to 2031-12-31, and 0.06667 in 2032-01-01 to 2033-05-11. Small 15-asset cross-section warrants conservative interpretation.",
